{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26934","headline":"和高谏议蒙兼宾客时入翰苑 · 姚合","name":"和高谏议蒙兼宾客时入翰苑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兼秩恩归第一流，时寻仙路向瀛洲。\n钟声迢递银河晓，林色葱笼玉露秋。\n紫殿讲筵邻御座，青宫宾榻入龙楼。\n从来共结归山侣，今日多应独自休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}